mvas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vomvas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vomvas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vomvas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vomvas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vomvas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vomvas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vomvas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vomvas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-05-21T19:14:33Z","updated_at":"2022-05-21T19:14:33Z","body":"Thanks for the quick resolution! I tried the new package and the above issue (Problem 1) is resolved!\r\n\r\nHowever, [Problem 2](https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1187#issuecomment-1133486139) persists in the new version. I hope the attached logs are useful.\r\n\r\n[open5gs_issue2.zip](https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/files/8748228/open5gs_issue2.zip)\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nMarinos\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1133754552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1133778993","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1187#issuecomment-1133778993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1187","id":1133778993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5DlBgx","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-05-21T22:46:42Z","updated_at":"2022-05-21T22:46:42Z","body":"@Vomvas \r\n\r\nThis might not be a open5gs bug.\r\n\r\nHere is the configuration difference between Problem1 and Problem2.\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n<nrf.conf>\r\n$ diff -u Problem1/open5gs_configs/nrf.yaml Problem2/open5gs_configs/nrf.yaml\r\n--- Problem1/open5gs_configs/nrf.yaml\t2022-05-21 10:45:00.000000000 +0900\r\n+++ Problem2/open5gs_configs/nrf.yaml\t2022-05-22 03:58:40.000000000 +0900\r\n@@ -81,12 +81,14 @@\r\n     sbi:\r\n       addr:\r\n         - 127.0.0.10\r\n-        - ::1\r\n       port: 7777\r\n```\r\n\r\nTo remove the IPv6 address for NRF, you need to change the `udm.conf` as below.\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n$ diff -u Problem1/open5gs_configs/udm.yaml Problem2/open5gs_configs/udm.yaml\r\n@@ -130,9 +130,7 @@\r\n #\r\n nrf:\r\n     sbi:\r\n-      - addr:\r\n-          - 127.0.0.10\r\n-          - ::1\r\n+      - addr: 127.0.0.10\r\n         port: 7777\r\n```\r\n\r\nNo ngap and pfcp packets in your pcapng. It is a little difficult when debugging because only http packets are shown. Please make sure to include this part the next time you run into problems.\r\n\r\nThanks a lot!\r\nSukchan","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1133778993/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart"